ຍ້າຍ box 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
ບວກ box 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
ລົບ box 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
ການເອີ້ນລະບົບ box         ; Show the final candy count!
